9,Stream Wisisi (West Papua) (RIAFC056) by RADIO IS A FOREIGN COUNTRY | Listen online for free on SoundCloud,https://soundcloud.com/radioisaforeigncountry/wisisi-west-papua,"A selection of wisisi music from West Papua. Wisisi or “sapusa” is a dance and genre of music among indigenous peoples in the mountains of West Papua. According to some, it was originally a dance perf",Waioli,West Papuan
